PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "BRENDAN: Hey! You must be {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "I've heard a lot about you.\n"
    .string "My name is BRENDAN. I came all the\l"
    .string "way from the HOENN region.\p"
    .string "I came looking for a challenge,\n"
    .string "and I certainly found one.\p"
    .string "Your friend... {RIVAL}, was it?\n"
    .string "He was strong. He actually beat the\l"
    .string "ELITE FOUR and became CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "But his reign didn't last long.\n"
    .string "I challenged him right after, and\l"
    .string "my team completely crushed him.\p"
    .string "Now, I sit at the absolute top.\n"
    .string "I am the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Show me the true power of KANTO!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "I knew you would come back.\p"
    .string "After you defeated me, I went back\n"
    .string "to HOENN to train my team from\l"
    .string "scratch.\p"
    .string "I've climbed MT. CHIMNEY and swam\n"
    .string "the depths of the ocean to push\l"
    .string "my POKéMON past their limits.\p"
    .string "I am the former CHAMPION, but today,\n"
    .string "I reclaim my throne!\p"
    .string "Let's have a battle for the ages!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Unbelievable...\n"
    .string "I gave it everything, and still lost!\p"
    .string "You really are the ultimate\n"
    .string "POKéMON master!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory::
    .string "BRENDAN: Hahaha! I won!\p"
    .string "I told you, the TRAINERS from\n"
    .string "HOENN are on another level!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "To think that my ultimate team\n"
    .string "could be defeated...\p"
    .string "Your bond with your POKéMON is\n"
    .string "something truly extraordinary.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you are the undeniable\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: So, you've won!\n"
    .string "Sincerely, congratulations!\p"
    .string "You're the new POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
    .string "CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "I watched the whole battle.\n"
    .string "You've grown up so much since you\l"
    .string "first left with your POKéMON.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you have come of age!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival::
    .string "OAK: BRENDAN...\n"
    .string "I must say, I am impressed by you.\p"
    .string "You traveled all the way from HOENN\n"
    .string "and defeated my grandson, {RIVAL},\l"
    .string "in the blink of an eye.\p"
    .string "But do you understand why {PLAYER}\n"
    .string "was able to defeat you?\p"
    .string "{PLAYER} has traveled across this\n"
    .string "entire region, forging an absolute\l"
    .string "bond of trust with their POKéMON.\p"
    .string "That bond is what makes a true\n"
    .string "CHAMPION!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You understand that your victory\n"
    .string "was not just your own doing.\p"
    .string "The bond you share with your\n"
    .string "POKéMON is marvelous.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Come with me!$"

